#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0353 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: BASETYPE is present, ByIND is populated, and ByIND is not equal to AyIND where ABLFL is equal to Y for a given value of PARAMCD and BASETYPE for a subject
#note "Same shape as the invalid sibling with B1IND=HIGH == A1IND=HIGH on the ABLFL=Y row -> noViolation. Non-vacuous by construction: the only difference from the firing fixture is the A1IND cell, so the rule demonstrably reaches the comparison."
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col BASETYPE type=Char
col ABLFL type=Char
col B1IND type=Char
col A1IND type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | LAST | Y | HIGH | HIGH
---
